{17 = 17-23}
1717.	The enemy troops established themselves everywere. @wRN{Tirigan}, 
1718.	the king of @wGN{Gutium} …… the mouths of the channels (?). 
1719.	Nobody came out of his city to face him; 
1720.	he already occupied both banks of the @wWN{Tigris}. In the south, 
1721.	in @wGN{Sumer}, he blocked the water from the fields, 
1722.	in the uplands he closed off the roads. 
1723.	Because of him the grass grew high on the highways of the land. 

{24 = 24-34}
2424.	But the king, endowed with power by @wDN{Enlil}, 
2425.	chosen by @wDN{Inana} with her @vart[t216.v1,t216.v1]{@varn{1 ms. adds:} holy } heart -- @wRN{@wDN{Utu}-ḫeŋal}, the mighty man, 
